    "homeType": "SINGLE_FAMILY",
    "description": "- Outer Parkside - Mid Century / Art Deco style Home (circa 1948) on a Highly Desirable Block!  The main level of this Warm Home features a Spacious West Facing living room with corner Fireplace, Open to the Formal Dining Room, Updated Kitchen, charming Period Bathroom with Separate Shower & Tub, and Two bedrooms.  With energy efficient LED lighting, and the windows and skylights, this home is Bright!  The first level has Garage Parking, Workbench and work area, a bonus Room and Bathroom, utility sink, and washer / dryer Hook ups.  The low maintenance and Level Back Yard completes this Move In Ready home.  Due to 40th Avenue ending at the corner with Yorba Street, and Yorba Street ending a  block from the corner, this location benefits significantly from its Lower Traffic than other locations.  With South Sunset Playground Park a block away, 2 Blocks to Sunset Super on Vicente, the nearby Lakeshore Plaza, San Francisco's Zoo, and many other neighborhood amenities, you will Love your new Location!  Other features include interior access from the garage that has a recently installed quiet garage door opener, electrical upgrade in 2000, newer water heater, gas heating system, coat and linen closets, crown molding, stone counters, gas range, and much more!"
  },
